.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ouch-decompress 1  "decompress " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
ouch\-decompress \- Decompresses one or more files, optionally into another folder
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBouch decompress\fR [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-dir\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-here\fR] [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-no\fR] [\fB\-A\fR|\fB\-\-accessible\fR] [\fB\-r\fR|\fB\-\-remove\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-password\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-threads\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-sandbox\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILES\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Decompresses one or more files, optionally into another folder
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-dir\fR \fI<OUTPUT_DIR>\fR
Decompress inside OUTPUT_DIR instead of the basename\-derived subdirectory
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip [Y/n] questions, default to yes
.TP
\fB\-\-here\fR
Extract directly into the current directory, like `tar \-xf` and `unzip` do
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-no\fR
Skip [Y/n] questions, default to no
.TP
\fB\-A\fR, \fB\-\-accessible\fR
Activate accessibility mode, reducing visual noise
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-remove\fR
Remove the source file after successful decompression
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Silence output
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Specify the format of the archive
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-password\fR \fI<PASSWORD>\fR
Decompress or list with password
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-threads\fR \fI<THREADS>\fR
Concurrent working threads
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-sandbox\fR
Disable the process sandbox
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILES\fR>
Files to be decompressed, or "\-" for stdin
